      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything just feels so quiet now. i keep thinking i hear him coming around the corner or the sound of his paws on the hardwood but then i remember he's actually gone. the house is just... too big and too empty. it feels pointless to even keep the lights on if there's no one left here to actually live in it.",
